    Takes inputs: {'program_id': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Identifier of the award program.'}, 'grant_year': {'type': 'integer', 'nullable': True, 'description': 'Optional calendar year to filter grants.  If *None*, all years are returned.'}}
    Returns an output of type: array
