    Takes inputs: {'grant_id': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Identifier of the grant.'}, 'valuation_type': {'type': 'string', 'nullable': True, 'description': 'Valuation label to query – defaults to "GrantDate".'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
- get_latest_valuation_for_program_tool: Return the most recent valuation recorded within a program.
    Takes inputs: {'program_id': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Award program identifier.'}}
    Returns an output of type: array
- calculate_dollar_value_tool: Compute *shares* × *fair_value_per_share*.
    Takes inputs: {'shares': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Number of shares.'}, 'fair_value_per_share': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Dollar value of a single share.'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
