    Takes inputs: {'amount_usd': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Raw dollar amount.'}, 'decimals': {'type': 'integer', 'nullable': True, 'description': 'Number of decimal places to round to (default ``1``).'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
